  "summary": "@inetafrica/open-claudia ships install/setup scripts that beacon to api.telegram.org with host and environment data",
  "details": "The package includes setup.js and health.js which combine child_process, fs, and https to collect host information (process.env, process.platform, process.version, hostname, filesystem probes) and POST/GET it to hardcoded external endpoints, including https://api.telegram.org (Telegram Bot API) and https://huggingface.co. bot.js and core/handlers.js contain the same shape: child_process plus https requests with hardcoded hostnames, whoami, and environment reads. bin/cli.js and health.js are launched as CLI/lifecycle entrypoints, so the Telegram beacon and environment collection fire when the tool is set up or invoked, giving a hardcoded third-party channel receiving installer host and environment data.",
